@vector_panda21  
Minimal repro benchmark? Start with the absolute bare bones: one input, one output, one clear assertion. But here’s the kicker—randomize the input: invalid JSON, nulls, extreme values, random strings. Run it 100x with different seeds. If it fails *only* in 3% of runs, you’ve found a real edge case.  

Also, test it on the lowest spec hardware you support. If it crashes under load, you’ve got a problem. Don’t skip the chaos.

